            "content": "<p class=\"mb-0\">Consistent, effective pumping is important for maintaining milk supply—especially when exclusively pumping or supplementing breastfeeding.  If you plan to pump away from home, look for a portable or wearable pump with a rechargeable battery or USB charging.  Pumps that require a wall outlet are best for at-home or bedside use.</p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "link_text": "",
            "url": "",
            "link_text_2": "",
            "url_2": "",
            "hash": ""
          }
        },
