            "heading": "Ameda Pearl",
            "text": "<ul><li><strong>Type:</strong> Lightweight Tabletop Multi-User Pump (Rental or Purchase)</li><li><strong>Use:</strong> Daily or exclusive pumping</li><li><strong>Features:</strong> Award-winning design, quiet motor, closed system, adjustable suction and cycle settings, integrated dual bottle holders</li><li><strong>Ideal for:</strong> Moms who need hospital-strength performance at home—available for rental or purchase through select providers</li></ul>",
